rovisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p039","quote":"三十九年，繆公卒，葬雍。從死者百七十七人，秦之良臣子輿氏三人名曰奄息、仲行、鍼虎，亦在從死之中。秦人哀之，為作歌黃鳥之詩。君子曰：「秦繆公廣地益國，東服彊晉，西霸戎夷，然不為諸侯盟主，亦宜哉。死而棄民，收其良臣而從死。且先王崩，尚猶遺德垂法，況奪之善人良臣百姓所哀者乎？是以知秦不能復東征也。」繆公子四十人，其太子嵤代立，是為康公。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin","source_term":"其太子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji005-049","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000405"]},{"id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAA","label":"秦共公","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"共公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0164","c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0000","c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0031","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p075:m0018","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076:m0000"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0164","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p040","quote":"共公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p041","quote":"共公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p041","quote":"共公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p075:m0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p075","quote":"共公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076:m0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076","quote":"共公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p040","quote":"康公元年。往歲繆公之卒，晉襄公亦卒；襄公之弟名雍，秦出也，在秦。晉趙盾欲立之，使隨會來迎雍，秦以兵送至令狐。晉立襄公子而反擊秦師，秦師敗，隨會來奔。二年，秦伐晉，取武城，報令狐之役。四年，晉伐秦，取少梁。六年，秦伐晉，取羈馬。戰於河曲，大敗晉軍。晉人患隨會在秦為亂，乃使魏讎餘詳反，合謀會，詐而得會，會遂歸晉。康公立十二年卒，子共公立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin","source_term":"子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji005-051","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000410"]},{"id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAA","label":"秦桓公","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"桓公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0039","c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0000","c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0099","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076:m0018","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p077:m0000"]},{"surface":"秦桓公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0055","c-shiji-039-jin:m109-0014"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m041-0039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p041","quote":"桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p042","quote":"桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0055","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p042","quote":"秦桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m042-0099","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p042","quote":"桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076:m0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p076","quote":"桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p077:m0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p077","quote":"桓公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m109-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p109","quote":"秦桓公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p041","quote":"共公二年，晉趙穿弒其君靈公。三年，楚莊王彊，北兵至雒，問周鼎。共公立五年卒，子桓公立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin",